-sname aquacell

## Set via environment in deployment. Never commit a real cookie.
-setcookie aquacell_dev_cookie_change_me

## Fleet scale: one twin process per device, plus ingest workers and pgo
## connections. 50k twins is comfortable for the default limit, but the
## default is worth raising now rather than discovering it under load.
+P 1048576

## Decision #31 is the reason this matters: dynamic atoms are never garbage
## collected. If a MAC ever reaches list_to_atom, this limit is the wall the
## node hits. Left at a deliberate, visible value so the failure is
## diagnosable rather than mysterious.
+t 1048576

## Async threads for file and port I/O.
+A 32

## No -heart. In a container the restart policy is the supervisor of last
## resort, and heart without a correctly exported HEART_COMMAND will kill a
## node it cannot restart.
